@SYSTEM_TITLE
PRINTL READY 日本語 中文
PRINTFORML FILE={EXISTFILE("csv/GAMEBASE.csv")}
PRINTFORML FILES={ENUMFILES("csv", "*.csv")}
PRINTL Enter 42, then submit.
INPUT
PRINTFORML ANSWER={RESULT}
FLAG:0 = RESULT
PRINTL Tap to test WAIT.
WAIT
PRINTL WAIT_DONE
TWAIT 100, 1
PRINTL TIMER_DONE
PRINTL Enter any text, then submit.
INPUTS
PRINTFORML TEXT=%RESULTS%
PRINTBUTTON "Choose OK", "OK"
BINPUTS
PRINTFORML BUTTON=%RESULTS%
PRINTL Compatibility check complete. Tap to return to the title.
WAIT
RETURN
